Package: ircam-viewer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: ffmpeg
Description: Linux viewer for USB infrared cameras
 ircam is a lightweight GUI for viewing and recording output from USB
 infrared cameras supported by the Linux uvcvideo driver.
 .
 It supports lossless 16-bit FFV1 recording, playback of recorded frames,
 live keyboard control of the view, and optional vendor-specific shutter
 controls for cameras that expose them.
